# Health-First Coach — environment variables
#
# NONE of these are required. The coaching engine is deterministic
# and runs fully client-side + via the /api/coach route without any
# external services. Copy this file to `.env.local` only if you want
# to enable the optional integrations below.

# Optional: layer a real LLM on top of the deterministic coach engine.
# The safety filter still wraps every response.
# ZAI_API_KEY=

# Optional: Prisma datasource. Only needed if you wire up the (currently
# unused) database layer in src/lib/db.ts.
# DATABASE_URL=file:./db/custom.db
